      "text": "Mr. K. Khan, learned PP assisted by Mr. S. Sengupta, learned Addl. PP appearing on behalf of the State respondent No. 1 submits that, before proceeding with the hearing on the merits of this case,\nsince the petitioner has arrayed the complainant as party respondent No. 2, therefore, in the first instance, notice may be directed to be issued upon the said respondent.\nThe learned counsel for the petitioner prays that he may be allowed to take steps for issuance of notice upon the respondent No. 2.",
